        "body": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title></title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\" />\n<link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\" />\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700;800&amp;family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" /><!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 1 — About the University\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.au-about, .au-about *, .au-about *::before, .au-about *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.au-about {\n  --au-blue:#086AD8; --au-navy:#0e2b3d; --au-ink:#55606b; --au-gold:#086AD8; --au-line:#e7e7e7;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.au-about .au-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.au-about .au-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); align-items: center; }\n@media (min-width: 62rem) { .au-about .au-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }\n\n/* ---- Image collage (matches .about-area .thumb) ---- */\n.au-about .au-thumb { position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 62rem) { .au-about .au-thumb { margin-bottom: 0; } }\n.au-about .au-thumb img { border-radius: 0.5rem; display: block; }\n.au-about .au-img-main { width: 80%; }\n.au-about .au-img-second {\n  position: relative; left: 20%; width: 80%; top: -5rem; margin-bottom: -5rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0.6rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18); padding: 0.3rem; background-color: #ffffff;\n}\n@media (max-width: 61.9rem) {\n  .au-about .au-img-second { display: none; }\n  .au-about .au-img-main { width: 100%; }\n}\n.au-about .au-overlay {\n  position: absolute; right: 0; top: 50%; height: 15.5rem; width: 15.5rem;\n  text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff; transform: translate(3.2rem, -50%);\n  border-radius: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 0 0.6rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18); z-index: 2;\n}\n@media (max-width: 74.9rem) and (min-width: 62rem) { .au-about .au-overlay { transform: translate(1rem, -50%); } }\n@media (max-width: 61.9rem) { .au-about .au-overlay { display: none; } }\n.au-about .au-overlay-content { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 100%; padding: 0 1.5rem; }\n.au-about .au-overlay-content .au-overlay-title { margin: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--au-navy); text-transform: capitalize; }\n\n/* ---- Info column ---- */\n.au-about .au-info { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.au-about .au-eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;\n  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--au-blue); margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.au-about .au-eyebrow::before { content: \"\"; width: 1.6rem; height: 2px; background-color: var(--au-blue); display: inline-block; }\n.au-about .au-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--au-navy); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.2vw, 2.2rem); line-height: 1.3; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }\n.au-about .au-text { color: var(--au-ink); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; }\n.au-about .au-memberships { list-style: none; margin: 1.875rem 0 0; padding: 0; }\n.au-about .au-memberships li { display: flex; margin-top: 1.875rem; }\n.au-about .au-memberships li:first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n.au-about .au-mem-icon { flex: none; font-size: 3.75rem; line-height: 1; margin-right: 1.5rem; color: var(--au-blue); }\n.au-about .au-mem-icon svg { width: 1em; height: 1em; display: block; }\n.au-about .au-mem-title { display: block; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--au-navy); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }\n.au-about .au-mem-text { color: var(--au-ink); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }\n.au-about .au-author { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-top: 1.875rem; }\n.au-about .au-signature { border-right: 1px solid var(--au-line); padding-right: 1.25rem; margin-right: 1.25rem; flex: none; }\n.au-about .au-signature img { height: 6.25rem; width: auto; display: block; }\n.au-about .au-intro-name { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--au-navy); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }\n.au-about .au-intro span { color: var(--au-ink); font-size: 0.9rem; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"au-about\" id=\"about-university\">\n<div class=\"au-container\">\n<div class=\"au-grid\">\n<div class=\"au-thumb\"><!-- Image URL: /uploads/shri-ganpatbhai-patel2-1787220919108.jpg --><img alt=\"Shri Ganpatbhai Patel, Patron-in-Chief and President, Ganpat University\" class=\"au-img-main\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/uploads/shri-ganpatbhai-patel2-1787220919108.jpg\" /> <!-- Image URL: /uploads/ganpat-uni-1787220917342.png --> <img alt=\"Ganpat University campus entrance\" class=\"au-img-second\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/uploads/ganpat-uni-1787220917342.png\" />\n<div class=\"au-overlay\">\n<div class=\"au-overlay-content\">\n<div class=\"au-overlay-title\">16 years of Excellence</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"au-info\">\n<div class=\"au-eyebrow\">About the University</div>\n\n<div class=\"au-title\">GANPAT UNIVERSITY -A Destination Of Smart Education</div>\n\n<p class=\"au-text\">Ganpat University and the township of Ganpat Vidyanagar, a high-tech education campus is a joint initiative, purely philanthropic in nature, by a large number of industrialists and technocrats, noble farmers and affluent businessmen for the mission of &ldquo;Social Upliftment through Education&rdquo;.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"au-memberships\">\n\t<li>\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M8.5 12.5 6 21l6-3 6 3-2.5-8.5\"></path></svg></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-info\">\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-title\">AIU Membership</div>\n\n\t<p class=\"au-mem-text\">Permanent Membership of Association of Indian Universities (AIU)</p>\n\t</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2 3 6l9 4 9-4-9-4Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 6v6c0 3 4 6 9 6s9-3 9-6V6\"></path></svg></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-info\">\n\t<div class=\"au-mem-title\">IAU Membership</div>\n\n\t<p class=\"au-mem-text\">Membership from Association of Commonwealth Universities (ACU), UK and International Association of Universities (IAU), France.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"au-author\">\n<div class=\"au-signature\"><!-- Image URL: /uploads/1577900788836-1787215412979.png --><img alt=\"signature\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/uploads/1577900788836-1787215412979.png\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"au-intro\">\n<div class=\"au-intro-name\">Shri. Ganpatbhai Patel</div>\n<span>Patron-in-Chief &amp; President</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 2 — News / Updates\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.nw-news, .nw-news *, .nw-news *::before, .nw-news *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.nw-news {\n  --nw-blue:#086AD8; --nw-navy:#0e2b3d; --nw-ink:#55606b; --nw-gold:#d99a2b; --nw-line:#e3e8f0;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.nw-news .nw-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.nw-news .nw-head { text-align: center; max-width: 36rem; margin: 0 auto 2.75rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--nw-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--nw-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); }\n.nw-news .nw-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.75rem; }\n@media (min-width: 48rem) { .nw-news .nw-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }\n.nw-news .nw-card { border: 1px solid var(--nw-line); border-radius: 0.85rem; overflow: hidden; background-color: #fff; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease; }\n.nw-news .nw-card:hover { transform: translateY(-0.3rem); box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 2.5rem -1rem rgba(14,43,61,0.18); }\n.nw-news .nw-thumb { display: block; aspect-ratio: 16/11; overflow: hidden; background-color: var(--nw-line); }\n.nw-news .nw-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }\n.nw-news .nw-card-body { padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem 1.5rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-date { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--nw-blue); letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; display: block; }\n.nw-news .nw-card-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--nw-navy); font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-card-title a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n.nw-news .nw-card-title a:hover { color: var(--nw-blue); }\n.nw-news .nw-excerpt { color: var(--nw-ink); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-readmore { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--nw-blue); text-decoration: none; }\n.nw-news .nw-readmore:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n.nw-news .nw-footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 2.75rem; }\n.nw-news .nw-btn { display: inline-block; background-color: var(--nw-blue); color: #fff; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.8rem 2rem; border-radius: 2rem; text-decoration: none; }\n.nw-news .nw-btn:hover { background-color: #06519f; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"nw-news\" id=\"news-updates\">\n<div class=\"nw-container\">\n<div class=\"nw-head\">\n<div class=\"nw-eyebrow\">News</div>\n\n<div class=\"nw-title\">Updates from GNU</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"nw-grid\">\n<div class=\"nw-card\"><a class=\"nw-thumb\" href=\"/news\"><img alt=\"Ganpat University selected for 5G technology research\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/2-511x400.jpg\" /> </a>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-body\"><span class=\"nw-date\">June 10, 2021</span>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-title\"><a href=\"/news\">Ganpat University is selected for 5G technology research (tie-ups with a USA based 5G technology company)</a></div>\n<a class=\"nw-readmore\" href=\"/news\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card\"><a class=\"nw-thumb\" href=\"/news\"><img alt=\"Ganpat University to introduce new 5G technology courses\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Sandesh-Ahmedabad-17-March-2021-451x400.jpg\" /> </a>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-body\"><span class=\"nw-date\">June 10, 2021</span>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-title\"><a href=\"/news\">Ganpat University will introduce new courses related to 5G technology</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"nw-excerpt\">Sandesh News Paper, Ahmedabad &mdash; 17.03.2021</p>\n<a class=\"nw-readmore\" href=\"/news\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card\"><a class=\"nw-thumb\" href=\"/news\"><img alt=\"Ganpat University allocated spectrum for 5G technology research\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Divyabhaskar-Mehsana_17_03_2021-512x400.jpg\" /> </a>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-body\"><span class=\"nw-date\">June 10, 2021</span>\n\n<div class=\"nw-card-title\"><a href=\"/news\">Ganpat University is allocated spectrum for 5G technology research, development and testing</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"nw-excerpt\">Divyabhaskar, Mehsana &mdash; 16.03.2021</p>\n<a class=\"nw-readmore\" href=\"/news\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"nw-footer\"><a class=\"nw-btn\" href=\"/news\">View All News</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 3 — Why Choose Us\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.wcu-features, .wcu-features *, .wcu-features *::before, .wcu-features *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.wcu-features {\n  --wcu-blue:#086AD8; --wcu-navy:#0e2b3d; --wcu-ink:#55606b; --wcu-gold:#d99a2b;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f5f8fc;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.wcu-features .wcu-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }\n@media (min-width: 60rem) { .wcu-features .wcu-container { grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr; } }\n.wcu-features .wcu-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--wcu-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--wcu-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.2vw, 2.15rem); line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-text { color: var(--wcu-ink); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-video { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--wcu-navy); font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-play { width: 2.75rem; height: 2.75rem; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--wcu-blue); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-video:hover .wcu-play { transform: scale(1.08); }\n.wcu-features .wcu-play svg { width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item { background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0.85rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.35rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0.6rem 1.75rem -0.8rem rgba(14,43,61,0.18); }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-icon { width: 3rem; height: 3rem; margin: 0 auto 0.9rem; border-radius: 0.65rem; background-color: #eaf2fd; color: var(--wcu-blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-icon svg { width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-title a { color: var(--wcu-navy); text-decoration: none; }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-title a:hover { color: var(--wcu-blue); }\n.wcu-features .wcu-item-text { color: var(--wcu-ink); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"wcu-features\" id=\"why-choose-us\">\n<div class=\"wcu-container\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"wcu-eyebrow\">Why Choose Us</div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-title\">Ultimate destination for 5G Technology Research</div>\n\n<p class=\"wcu-text\">Ganpat University offers various unique, quality, industry-linked and sector-focused Diploma, Undergraduate, Postgraduate and Research level programs (professional and non-professional) in the fields of Engineering, Management, Computer Applications, Pharmacy, Sciences, Commerce &amp; Social Science, Architecture, Design &amp; Planning, Maritime Studies and Law.</p>\n<a class=\"wcu-video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OsoXEo1wpYI\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"wcu-play\"><svg fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"></path></svg></span> Video Showcase </a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-grid\">\n<div class=\"wcu-item\">\n<div class=\"wcu-item-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 3v5L4 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.8 3h12.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.8-3L15 8V3\"></path><path d=\"M9 3h6\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 14h9\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item-title\"><a href=\"/research-area\">Research Work</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"wcu-item-text\">A great platform for smart research work.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item\">\n<div class=\"wcu-item-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.2\"></circle><path d=\"M6.5 6.5a8 8 0 0 0 0 11M17.5 6.5a8 8 0 0 1 0 11M3.5 3.5a12.5 12.5 0 0 0 0 17M20.5 3.5a12.5 12.5 0 0 1 0 17\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item-title\"><a href=\"/testing\">Realtime Testing</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"wcu-item-text\">Perform real-time instrument testing in workshops.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item\">\n<div class=\"wcu-item-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item-title\"><a href=\"/expression-of-interest-einfochips\">Global Presence</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"wcu-item-text\">Providing worldwide availability for research scholars.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item\">\n<div class=\"wcu-item-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M8.5 12.5 6 21l6-3 6 3-2.5-8.5\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wcu-item-title\"><a href=\"/antenna-design-and-measurement\">Course Certification</a></div>\n\n<p class=\"wcu-item-text\">Get an industry-approved training certificate for research.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 4 — How We Work\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.hww-process, .hww-process *, .hww-process *::before, .hww-process *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.hww-process {\n  --hww-blue:#086AD8; --hww-navy:#0e2b3d; --hww-ink:#55606b; --hww-gold:#d99a2b; --hww-line:#e3e8f0;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.hww-process .hww-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.hww-process .hww-head { text-align: center; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto 3rem; }\n.hww-process .hww-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hww-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.hww-process .hww-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hww-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); }\n.hww-process .hww-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.75rem 1.5rem; position: relative; }\n@media (min-width: 60rem) { .hww-process .hww-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }\n@media (min-width: 60rem) {\n  .hww-process .hww-grid::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 1.6rem; left: 12%; right: 12%; height: 1px; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, var(--hww-line) 60%, transparent 0%); background-size: 0.6rem 1px; background-repeat: repeat-x; z-index: 0; }\n}\n.hww-process .hww-step { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; }\n.hww-process .hww-num {\n  width: 3.25rem; height: 3.25rem; margin: 0 auto 1.1rem; border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: var(--hww-blue); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--hww-blue), #06519f);\n  color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px #f5f8fc;\n}\n.hww-process .hww-step-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hww-navy); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n.hww-process .hww-step-text { color: var(--hww-ink); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 15rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"hww-process\" id=\"how-we-work\">\n<div class=\"hww-container\">\n<div class=\"hww-head\">\n<div class=\"hww-eyebrow\">Process</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-title\">How We Work</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-grid\">\n<div class=\"hww-step\">\n<div class=\"hww-num\">01</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step-title\">Collaborations</div>\n\n<p class=\"hww-step-text\">Partnering with industry and research bodies to shape joint 5G initiatives.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step\">\n<div class=\"hww-num\">02</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step-title\">Seminars &amp; Workshops</div>\n\n<p class=\"hww-step-text\">Hands-on sessions that bring scholars, faculty and experts together.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step\">\n<div class=\"hww-num\">03</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step-title\">Research Work</div>\n\n<p class=\"hww-step-text\">Focused study and experimentation across 5G and allied technologies.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step\">\n<div class=\"hww-num\">04</div>\n\n<div class=\"hww-step-title\">Industry Outcomes</div>\n\n<p class=\"hww-step-text\">Translating research into real, deployable industry results.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 5 — Research Scholars / Portfolio\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.rs-portfolio, .rs-portfolio *, .rs-portfolio *::before, .rs-portfolio *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.rs-portfolio {\n  --rs-blue:#086AD8; --rs-navy:#0e2b3d; --rs-ink:#55606b; --rs-gold:#d99a2b;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #0e2b3d;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.rs-portfolio .rs-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }\n@media (min-width: 60rem) { .rs-portfolio .rs-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.9fr; } }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rs-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.2vw, 2.15rem); line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-text { color: #c7d2db; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-list { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 1.75rem; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-list li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; color: #fff; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-list li svg { width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; color: var(--rs-gold); flex: none; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-btn { display: inline-block; background-color: var(--rs-blue); color: #fff; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.8rem 2rem; border-radius: 2rem; text-decoration: none; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-btn:hover { background-color: #06519f; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-media { position: relative; max-width: 24rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-media img { width: 100%; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: block; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-stat {\n  position: absolute; right: -1rem; bottom: -1.25rem; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 2.5rem -1rem rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\n}\n.rs-portfolio .rs-stat-num { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.9rem; color: var(--rs-blue); line-height: 1; }\n.rs-portfolio .rs-stat-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--rs-ink); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.2rem; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"rs-portfolio\" id=\"research-scholars\">\n<div class=\"rs-container\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"rs-eyebrow\">Our Portfolio</div>\n\n<div class=\"rs-title\">Trusted by 5,000+ Research Scholars</div>\n\n<p class=\"rs-text\">We are always happy to connect with more industry experts to collaborate with Ganpat University. In this way, we can provide excellent training and research facilities to scholars who join us &mdash; and we welcome every piece of feedback that helps us improve our programs.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"rs-list\">\n\t<li><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> 100% Research Satisfaction</li>\n\t<li><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> World Class Facilities</li>\n</ul>\n<a class=\"rs-btn\" href=\"/news\">Completed Seminars</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"rs-media\"><img alt=\"Research scholars at Ganpat University\" src=\"/uploads/3-1787220891757.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"rs-stat\">\n<div class=\"rs-stat-num\">125+</div>\n\n<div class=\"rs-stat-label\">Completed Seminars</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 6 — What We Do\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.wwd-services, .wwd-services *, .wwd-services *::before, .wwd-services *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.wwd-services {\n  --wwd-blue:#086AD8; --wwd-navy:#0e2b3d; --wwd-ink:#55606b; --wwd-gold:#d99a2b; --wwd-line:#e3e8f0;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f5f8fc;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.wwd-services .wwd-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-head { text-align: center; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto 3rem; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--wwd-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--wwd-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); }\n.wwd-services .wwd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 48rem) { .wwd-services .wwd-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card { background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--wwd-line); border-radius: 0.85rem; padding: 2rem 1.6rem; text-align: center; transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card:hover { transform: translateY(-0.25rem); box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 2.5rem -1rem rgba(14,43,61,0.18); }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-icon { width: 3.25rem; height: 3.25rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 0.7rem; background-color: #eaf2fd; color: var(--wwd-blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-icon svg { width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--wwd-navy); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-text { color: var(--wwd-ink); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-link { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--wwd-blue); text-decoration: none; }\n.wwd-services .wwd-card-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"wwd-services\" id=\"what-we-do\">\n<div class=\"wwd-container\">\n<div class=\"wwd-head\">\n<div class=\"wwd-eyebrow\">Research</div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-title\">What We Do</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-grid\">\n<div class=\"wwd-card\">\n<div class=\"wwd-card-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-card-title\">Research Area</div>\n\n<p class=\"wwd-card-text\">Currently we are carrying out extensive research and analysis in the domain of 5G technology to meet the upcoming demands of internet, data and communication.</p>\n<a class=\"wwd-card-link\" href=\"/research-area\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-card\">\n<div class=\"wwd-card-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17 20h5v-1a4 4 0 0 0-4-4h-1M9 20H4v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h1m2-3a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Zm6 1a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-card-title\">Collaborations</div>\n\n<p class=\"wwd-card-text\">We believe in collaborating with growing organizations and industries to achieve excellent outcomes in our research work.</p>\n<a class=\"wwd-card-link\" href=\"https://opennetworking.org/member-listing/\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-card\">\n<div class=\"wwd-card-icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6l-8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m9.2 12 1.9 1.9 3.7-3.9\"></path></svg></div>\n\n<div class=\"wwd-card-title\">Testing</div>\n\n<p class=\"wwd-card-text\">GUNI-ATCNN works closely with industry partners in supporting and fulfilling their business and social objectives.</p>\n<a class=\"wwd-card-link\" href=\"/testing\">Read More &rarr;</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 7 — Our Collaborations\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.oc-collab, .oc-collab *, .oc-collab *::before, .oc-collab *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.oc-collab {\n  --oc-blue:#086AD8; --oc-navy:#0e2b3d; --oc-ink:#55606b; --oc-gold:#d99a2b; --oc-line:#e3e8f0;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.oc-collab .oc-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.oc-collab .oc-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.75rem; }\n.oc-collab .oc-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--oc-gold); }\n.oc-collab .oc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }\n@media (min-width: 48rem) { .oc-collab .oc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }\n.oc-collab .oc-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.1rem; border: 1px solid var(--oc-line); border-radius: 0.85rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }\n.oc-collab .oc-card:hover { transform: translateY(-0.2rem); box-shadow: 0 1rem 2rem -0.8rem rgba(14,43,61,0.2); }\n.oc-collab .oc-logo { flex: none; width: 3.5rem; height: 3.5rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; background-color: #f5f8fc; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.5rem; }\n.oc-collab .oc-logo img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }\n.oc-collab .oc-name { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--oc-navy); font-size: 1rem; }\n.oc-collab .oc-tag { color: var(--oc-ink); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.1rem; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"oc-collab\" id=\"our-collaborations\">\n<div class=\"oc-container\">\n<div class=\"oc-head\">\n<div class=\"oc-eyebrow\">Our Collaborations</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"oc-grid\">\n<a class=\"oc-card\" href=\"https://opennetworking.org/member-listing/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <div class=\"oc-logo\"><img alt=\"ONF logo\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/ONG.png\" /></div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"oc-name\">ONF</div>\n    <div class=\"oc-tag\">Open Networking Foundation</div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"oc-card\" href=\"https://tsdsi.in/present_members/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <div class=\"oc-logo\"><img alt=\"TSDSI logo\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Tsdsi.png\" /></div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"oc-name\">TSDSI</div>\n    <div class=\"oc-tag\">Telecom Standards Development Society, India</div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"oc-card\" href=\"/expression-of-interest-einfochips\">\n  <div class=\"oc-logo\"><img alt=\"Einfochips logo\" src=\"https://atcnn.guni.ac.in/ut/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/eic-arrow-logo-dark-1.png\" /></div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"oc-name\">Einfochips</div>\n    <div class=\"oc-tag\">Industry Collaboration Partner</div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 8 — Leadership / Governance\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.lt-team, .lt-team *, .lt-team *::before, .lt-team *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.lt-team {\n  --lt-blue:#086AD8; --lt-navy:#0e2b3d; --lt-ink:#55606b; --lt-gold:#d99a2b;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f5f8fc;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.lt-team .lt-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n.lt-team .lt-head { text-align: center; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto 2.75rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--lt-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--lt-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); }\n.lt-team .lt-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.75rem; max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; }\n@media (min-width: 36rem) { .lt-team .lt-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }\n.lt-team .lt-card { background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0.85rem; overflow: hidden; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0.6rem 1.75rem -0.9rem rgba(14,43,61,0.2); }\n.lt-team .lt-thumb { aspect-ratio: 4/3.4; overflow: hidden; }\n.lt-team .lt-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }\n.lt-team .lt-card-body { padding: 1.25rem 1.1rem 1.5rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-name { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--lt-navy); font-size: 1.02rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-role { color: var(--lt-ink); font-size: 0.85rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; }\n.lt-team .lt-btn { display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: var(--lt-blue); border: 2px solid var(--lt-blue); font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 2rem; text-decoration: none; }\n.lt-team .lt-btn:hover { background-color: var(--lt-blue); color: #fff; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"lt-team\" id=\"leadership-team\">\n<div class=\"lt-container\">\n<div class=\"lt-head\">\n<div class=\"lt-eyebrow\">Governance</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-title\">Meet Our Leadership</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-grid\">\n<div class=\"lt-card\">\n<div class=\"lt-thumb\"><img alt=\"Padmashri Ganpatbhai Patel\" src=\"/uploads/shri-ganpatbhai-patel2-1787220919108.jpg\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-card-body\">\n<div class=\"lt-name\">Padmashri Ganpatbhai Patel</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-role\">Patron-in-Chief &amp; President</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-card\">\n<div class=\"lt-thumb\"><img alt=\"Dr. Mahendra Sharma\" src=\"/uploads/mahendra-sharma-1787299901168.png\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-card-body\">\n<div class=\"lt-name\">Dr. Mahendra Sharma</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-role\">Pro-Chancellor and Director General</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lt-footer\"><a class=\"lt-btn\" href=\"/advisory-committee\">View All</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- =========================================================\n     SECTION 9 — FAQ\n     ========================================================= -->\n<style type=\"text/css\">.faq-section, .faq-section *, .faq-section *::before, .faq-section *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.faq-section {\n  --faq-blue:#086AD8; --faq-navy:#0e2b3d; --faq-ink:#55606b; --faq-gold:#d99a2b; --faq-line:#e3e8f0;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;\n}\n.faq-section .faq-container { max-width: 75rem; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }\n@media (min-width: 55rem) { .faq-section .faq-container { grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; } }\n.faq-section .faq-eyebrow { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faq-gold); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }\n.faq-section .faq-title { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--faq-navy); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }\n.faq-section .faq-viewall { display: inline-block; color: var(--faq-blue); font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--faq-blue); padding-bottom: 0.15rem; }\n.faq-section .faq-list { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; }\n.faq-section details { border: 1px solid var(--faq-line); border-radius: 0.65rem; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f8fc; overflow: hidden; }\n.faq-section summary {\n  list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;\n  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--faq-navy); font-size: 0.96rem;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;\n}\n.faq-section summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n.faq-section summary::after {\n  content: \"+\"; flex: none; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: var(--faq-blue); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1;\n}\n.faq-section details[open] summary::after { content: \"–\"; }\n.faq-section .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.3rem 1.2rem; color: var(--faq-ink); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"faq-section\" id=\"faq-section\">\n<div class=\"faq-container\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"faq-eyebrow\">FAQ</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-title\">Most common answer and question</div>\n<a class=\"faq-viewall\" href=\"#faq-section\">View All FAQs</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-list\">\n<details open=\"\"><summary>What is 5G Technology?</summary>\n\n<p class=\"faq-answer\">In telecommunications, 5G is the fifth-generation technology standard for broadband cellular networks, which cellular phone companies began deploying worldwide in 2019. It is the planned successor to 4G networks, which provide connectivity to most current cellphones.</p>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Who can attend 5G Technology workshops?</summary>\n\n<p class=\"faq-answer\">Any individual student, faculty member, industry expert or research fellow can join our seminars and workshops.</p>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Who can collaborate with GNU for 5G?</summary>\n\n<p class=\"faq-answer\">Ganpat University actively collaborates with various technological institutes and R&amp;D organizations in India and abroad. Various collaboration models are followed to suit the institute and the project context.</p>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
